            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in CapyBar 1.0.6</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Idle CPU usage is much lower. The dashboard is torn down when the menu closes, so it no longer redraws in the background.</li>
  <li>The panel stays readable when a bright window is behind it.</li>
  <li>Clicking outside the dashboard now closes it.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
